NOTICE — networkx-rust

This repository contains an independent implementation of a Dijkstra
shortest-path kernel written in Rust, plus a Python dispatch layer that
calls it for stock numeric edge weights and otherwise delegates to
networkx itself. No networkx source code is copied here.

Upstream project attributed:

