  https://github.com/networkx/networkx/blob/main/LICENSE.txt).
  If you use the fallback paths of this package, you run networkx code
  under that license.

Scope: only the Dijkstra shortest-path family
(`single_source_*`, `multi_source_*`, `dijkstra_path(_length)`,
`dijkstra_predecessor_and_distance`, `all_pairs_dijkstra*`) is
accelerated. Everything else — graph classes, generators, all other
algorithms — stays verbatim upstream networkx and is never reimplemented
here.
